        "---\n",
        "### Where we are\n",
        "\n",
        "| | Module 3 | Module 4 |\n",
        "|---|---|---|\n",
        "| the label | a category: goal / no goal, default / repay | **a number**: a price, a fare, a wage |\n",
        "| the model outputs | a probability, then a decision | **the number itself** |\n",
        "| the mistake | wrong box in the confusion matrix | **a distance**: how far off, in dollars |\n",
        "| what we judge | precision, recall, cost | **the size of the typical miss** |\n",
        "\n",
        "Everything else — partition, preprocessing fit on train only, replicate on test, cross-validation — is Module 2, unchanged."
