      "source": [
        "### Preprocessing\n",
        "\n",
        "A `ColumnTransformer`: numeric columns get median imputation; the text column gets one-hot encoding. Fit on the training split, replicated on everything else — automatically, because it lives inside the pipeline.\n",
        "\n",
        "We also add three **ratio features** an economist would want: rooms per household, bedrooms per room, people per household. Totals describe the neighbourhood's size; ratios describe its houses."
